<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS3" title="In Appendix A Extended Discussion: Structural Vulnerabilities in RL Pipelines ‣ On the Structural Non-Preservation of Epistemic Behaviour under Policy Transformation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.3 </span>Temporal Erosion of Structured Exploration</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In On the Structural Non-Preservation of Epistemic Behaviour under Policy Transformation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Supplemental Material: Experimental Details</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS1" title="In Appendix B Supplemental Material: Experimental Details ‣ On the Structural Non-Preservation of Epistemic Behaviour under Policy Transformation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.1 </span>Environment Specification: The Abstract Epistemic MDP</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS2" title="In Appendix B Supplemental Material: Experimental Details ‣ On the Structural Non-Preservation of Epistemic Behaviour under Policy Transformation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.2 </span>optimisation and Hyperparameters</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS3" title="In Appendix B Supplemental Material: Experimental Details ‣ On the Structural Non-Preservation of Epistemic Behaviour under Policy Transformation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.3 </span>Sensitivity to Prior Skew</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS4" title="In Appendix B Supplemental Material: Experimental Details ‣ On the Structural Non-Preservation of Epistemic Behaviour under Policy Transformation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.4 </span>Effect of Network Capacity under Extreme Skew</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS5" title="In Appendix B Supplemental Material: Experimental Details ‣ On the Structural Non-Preservation of Epistemic Behaviour under Policy Transformation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.5 </span>Implications for Structural Preservation</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
